Date:   Wed Feb 15 09:14:53 2023 +0100

    Add error handling for deps in type wrapper initialization (#1557)

    * Add error handling for deps in type wrapper initialization

    The xtypes type wrapper did not check the return value of the
    register dependencies function calls, which resulted in ignoring
    validation error in dependent types (e.g. a structs member types).
    This fixes the issue by checking and propagating these errors.

    Signed-off-by: Dennis Potman <dennis@zettascale.tech>

    * Fix in error handling for union type in add_complete_typeobj

    Signed-off-by: Dennis Potman <dennis@zettascale.tech>

    ---------

    Signed-off-by: Dennis Potman <dennis@zettascale.tech>

